   "x": 4184.799999999999,
   "y": 1260.0,
   "width": 72.0,
   "height": 30.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "改善点",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "改善点",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12746,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 56396,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1819",
   "x": 4184.799999999999,
   "y": 1302.0,
   "width": 415.5999999999999,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "1. 方針(ResourceBuildContext 経由)はほぼ徹底できた",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. 方針(ResourceBuildContext 経由)はほぼ徹底できた",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12753,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 56427,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1820",
   "x": 4184.799999999999,
   "y": 1322.0,
   "width": 588.8000000000003,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    IO 群・Model / Texture / Material / Shader の緑矢印は消えた。\n    ResourceManager::Instance() が残るのは ResourceRef<T> の中だけで、\n    値として資産に埋まるので引数で渡せない、という理由が付いている。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    IO 群・Model / Texture / Material / Shader の緑矢印は消えた。\n    ResourceManager::Instance() が残るのは ResourceRef<T> の中だけで、\n    値として資産に埋まるので引数で渡せない、という理由が付いている。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12760,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 56458,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1821",
   "x": 4184.799999999999,
   "y": 1402.0,
   "width": 434.00000000000017,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. GraphicsEngine が欲しくて MainEngine を引いている",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. GraphicsEngine が欲しくて MainEngine を引いている",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12767,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 56489,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1822",
   "x": 4184.799999999999,
   "y": 1422.0,
   "width": 617.4000000000001,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    ScopedResourceBuild はバッチを開くため、Mesh::Release は\n    MeshBufferAllocator へ返すため(Release には Context が来ない)。\n    ScopedResourceBuild は引数で受け取り、Mesh は解放の口を渡しておきたい。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    ScopedResourceBuild はバッチを開くため、Mesh::Release は\n    MeshBufferAllocator へ返すため(Release には Context が来ない)。\n    ScopedResourceBuild は引数で受け取り、Mesh は解放の口を渡しておきたい。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12774,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 56520,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1823",
   "x": 4184.799999999999,
   "y": 1502.0,
   "width": 283.79999999999995,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "3. Sound / SoundIO → AudioManager",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "3. Sound / SoundIO → AudioManager",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12781,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 56551,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1824",
   "x": 4184.799999999999,
   "y": 1522.0,
   "width": 463.60000000000014,
   "height": 40.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    サウンドの読み込みにオーディオエンジンが要る。\n    AudioManager のポインタを Context に載せるのが素直。",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    サウンドの読み込みにオーディオエンジンが要る。\n    AudioManager のポインタを Context に載せるのが素直。",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
